  "description": "AI-agent toolset for TerraPDF. Lets an LLM create PDF documents by calling a\n      tool with a declarative JSON document (headings, paragraphs, tables, lists,\n      key/value blocks, charts, images, barcodes, QR codes, columns). Exposes the\n      tools as Microsoft.Extensions.AI AIFunctions, so they plug directly into the\n      Microsoft Agent Framework, Semantic Kernel, and any IChatClient. Validation\n      errors are returned to the model with JSON paths so it can correct itself.",
